  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k0014",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "As ",
          "_key": "k0015"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "Dylan Field",
          "_key": "k0016"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", Figma’s Co-Founder + CEO, stepped onto Config’s stage on Wednesday wearing a “Now with AI” t-shirt, I knew we were in for a treat – and this year’s announcements did not disappoint. Here’s a list of updates, features + products announced at Config 2024 that I’m most excited about:",
          "_key": "k0017"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0000",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/dylanfield"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0018",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Work smarter, not harder",
          "_key": "k0019"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0020",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "From finding designs with visual search to generating UI designs with prompts to renaming layers with a click of a button, ",
          "_key": "k0021"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0001"
          ],
          "text": "Figma AI",
          "_key": "k0022"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " is going to streamline our daily workflow + help us be more efficient.",
          "_key": "k0023"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0001",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://www.figma.com/ai/"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
